        <summary lang="en_GB">Watara Supervision</summary>
        <description lang="en_GB">The Watara Supervision is a monochrome handheld game console released in 1992 as a cheaper rival to the Game Boy. The screen of the original model sits on a flexible neck so it can be tilted toward the player.</description>
